From: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Local: media: cedrus: complete vendor adaptive rate control

Match vendor MAD prediction and startup quantizers.
Add motion-based VBR budgets and optional adaptive skip maps.

Signed-off-by: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
---
